### Courses – variabili
@baseUrl        = http://localhost:3000
@courseId       = 31f8fd18-0dad-4190-9613-49750190e882
@slug           = nestjs-avanzato
@instructorId   = 68f32c02-23a0-4352-85e0-a9a93b79403f
@categoryId     = bd9690ff-20a3-43bc-90f2-4f7672ad0694
@instructorToken = INSTRUCTOR_JWT_TOKEN
@adminToken     = ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN

# ─── GET (pubblici) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Get All Courses con paginazione
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?page=1&limit=10

### 2. Get All Courses filtrati per categoria
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?page=1&limit=10&category=Web Development

### 3. Search Courses per keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/search?q=type

### 4. Get Course by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}

### 5. Get Course by Slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/slug/{{slug}}

# ─── POST / PATCH / DELETE (protetti) ────────────────────────────────

### 6. Create New Course (richiede auth instructor/admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}

{
  "title": "Laravel 13: Guida Completa",
  "slug": "laravel-13-guida-completa",
  "description": "Sviluppo backend moderno con PHP 8.4 e Laravel 13.",
  "price": 54.99,
  "status": "DRAFT",
  "category_id": "{{categoryId}}",
  "instructor_id": "{{instructorId}}",
  "thumbnail_url": "https://example.com/images/laravel-13.jpg"
}

### 7. Update Course – solo price
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}

{
  "price": 75.25
}

### 8. Update Course – cambio status a PENDING (richiede approvazione admin)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}

{
  "status": "PENDING"
}

### 9. Soft Delete Course
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{instructorToken}}

### 10. Restore Course (soft-deleted)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

# ─── Edge cases ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 11. Get Course inesistente (atteso 404) esce 400 ma per ora va bene
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000999

### 12. Create senza auth (atteso 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test senza token"
}
